{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>These lands.</b> For the land of the Philistines too is included in the land of Israel, as they explained in the perasha of Va'era." "<b>These.</b> An allusion to the thirty-one kings that Joshua conquered." "<b>And shall bless themselves by your seed.</b> Rav Yosef ben Tuviah said: by your seed — all the nations of the earth shall intermingle. As we learned: whether one grafts or one cross-pollinates."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:00.049371633Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}